# The Scrum Master's read-only GitHub token (SB-1385). Copy to .env.scrum (gitignored)
# and run with both env files:
#   op run --env-file .env --env-file .env.scrum -- uv run scrum-master report
#
# A fine-grained personal access token limited to the repositories in scrum.toml,
# with READ-ONLY permissions: Contents, Pull requests, Commit statuses
# (Metadata read is implied). See docs/scrum-master.md about CI status. Not CYCLE_RUNNER_GITHUB_TOKEN: that one can push.
SCRUM_GITHUB_TOKEN=op://agents/cycle-runner-github-read/credential
